{"author":{"id":"e8ccbc170af88335916e23a1b24e48c04b0a4af82e988d5245cc91e39d6a9e2c"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1794491126,"nonce":"gtiRfFtikD97QzIR6H2RPA/zHc8=","title":"L8 — Turso history/settings store and Keychain API key","message":"## Context\nLocal persistence: comparison history (reopenable without the network), settings, custom presets and the FX cache in embedded Turso. The Gemini key goes in the macOS Keychain. This layer is plan Task 10 (`docs/superpowers/plans/2026-11-12-maeve.md:377`).\n\n## Files\n- `src/store.rs`, `src/settings.rs` — new; export from `src/lib.rs`\n- `Cargo.toml` — add `turso` (0.8), `keyring` (apple-native), `dirs`; dev: `tempfile`\n\n## Approach\n- Implement plan Task 10 Interfaces: `Settings` (+ defaults: Es, System, `gemini-flash-latest` ×2, rpm 10, `CostSettings::default()`, no FX override), `ComparisonRecord`, `HistoryEntry`, `Store` methods, `default_db_path`, `load_api_key`/`save_api_key` (service `maeve`, user `gemini_api_key`)\n- Define `pub enum ThemePref { System, Light, Dark }` in `src/settings.rs`; the UI epic's theme module imports it from there\n- Tables `comparisons`, `presets`, `kv` as in the plan; payload stored as JSON\n\n## Depends on\nL7 — `CompareInput`, `ComparisonResult`; L5 — `Preset`, `Lang`; L1 — `FxRate`, `CostSettings`\n\n## Out of scope\n- Settings UI (epic \"Maeve UI\")\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- Plan Task 10 Step 1 tests pass on a temp DB: save/list newest first, load round-trip, re-saving a reopened record gets a new id and leaves the original, default settings when empty, custom preset upsert by name\n- `Settings` has no field that could hold the API key\n- Manual: `save_api_key` then `load_api_key` returns it (real Keychain)\n- Gates pass: `cargo fmt --check`, `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings`, `cargo test`","files":null}]}